1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,970
Why are 3 × 4 and 4 × 3
the same?

2
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:11,290
4 in each row, 3 rows

3
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:14,510
Now let's turn the whole thing

4
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:19,180
Now 3 in each row, 4 rows

5
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:24,050
We only turned it,
so the count stays the same!

6
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:26,520
What if we turn the dots into squares?

7
00:00:26,570 --> 00:00:29,390
Multiplication = the area of a rectangle

8
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:34,290
Stand it up — the area is still 12 squares

9
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:39,040
NEXT: Why does long multiplication for 13 × 12 work?
